	(descr "CnC Tech 220-1-28-006 double-male machined-pin DIP-28 adapter, 2.54 mm pitch, 15.24 mm (600 mil) rows, LCSC C17505093. Placement/BOM item only: its pins go through the J3/J4 holes, so the footprint has no pads. Origin at the centre of the pin field, rows along X, as in JLCPCB's HDR-TH_220-1-28-006 footprint. Fab outline approximate. https://www.cnctech.us/productdetails.asp?ID=760")
